	(text "Target: one independently regulated USB-C PD source port, 65 W maximum.\n\nRequired chain:\n24 V protected input → adjustable synchronous buck → controlled VBUS/OCP/discharge → USB-C receptacle\n                                           ↘ TPS25750D PD policy / CC / VCONN / PDO control\n\nCapture is blocked until: controller procurement/configuration, 5 A e-marked cable behaviour, converter\ntransition policy, VBUS protection, receptacle mechanics and component ratings are verified.\n\nDo not connect 24 V directly to VBUS. Do not connect a Dell PC before the electronic-load validation plan passes."
